      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-11-11_WidnesExaminer_art0062" n="art0062">
        <head>"FIRST PRIZE WON."</head>
        <p>"FIRST PRIZE WON."</p>
        <p>"Dear Uncle Jack,—Many thanks for the beautiful book you 'sent me on Saturday. ' I have read a, part of the book and it is.very in- teresting. It is the first book I have won, and I hope it will not be the last.—l remain, 3-Qur loving niece, LIZZIE LEWIS, No. 888.</p>
