      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-11-11_WidnesExaminer_art0107" n="art0107">
        <p>France for over a fortnight before being con- sidered fit to travel to England.</p>
        <p>Corporal Varley came to England a consider- able number of years ago, and soon became a highly-respected workman of the Pearson and Knowles Coal and Iron Co., Ltd. A Roman Catholic, he , attended St. Alban's Church. A brother, Private James Varley, was reported missing twelve months ago, and nothing has been heard of him since.</p>
