        <p>PRIVATE HAROLD LIGFITFOOT Wounded.</p>
        <p>Arthur, is also in the Army, and that popular Bewsey circular -!bus driver is another brother.</p>
        <p>IN HOSPITAL. PRIVATE E. I. RICKERS. In London Hospital Suffering From 'French Fever. Private Eric I. Rickers, of the South Lanca- shire Regiment, son of Mr. and Mrs. E. Rickers, 184, Wellfield-street, has been brought to a London hospital suffering from trench fever. He is progressing favourably. Private Rickers, who is twenty years of age,</p>
